# This directory stores the OTEL Collector binaries and runtime files

## Standard Collector (otelcol-contrib)
Downloaded automatically when you run: `npm run collector:start`

## Sentry Exporter Collector (otelcol-sentry)
Built from the Sentry fork with the native Sentry exporter.
See: https://github.com/getsentry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/tree/feat/sentryexporter

To build:
1. Clone: git clone --branch feat/sentryexporter https://github.com/getsentry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib.git
2. Generate: cd cmd/otelcontribcol && make genotelcontribcol
3. Build: go build -o otelcol-sentry .
4. Copy: cp otelcol-sentry to this directory

## Files in this directory (not committed):
- `otelcol-contrib` - Standard collector binary (~322MB)
- `otelcol-sentry` - Sentry exporter collector binary (~460MB)
- `collector.log` - Standard collector runtime logs
- `collector-sentry.log` - Sentry collector runtime logs
- `collector.pid` - Standard collector process ID
- `collector-sentry.pid` - Sentry collector process ID
